From 32df14b688b19153b6399a3455a525ab339915dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:13:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UI kit: shared header and scrolling list; mechanics list on
 the kit

arena_ui_kit.c adds UiHeader (the touch layout's top bar with [L] [R] and
Back, tappable) and UiList (a list of message rows with the shop's page
arrows, keys and taps). The mechanics topic list now uses them: classic is
the old window, touch is a full-width list under a "Battle mechanics"
header. The class viewer draws its header through the kit.

The shop bank had no room left: the English banks from battle onward move
up 0x2000 (ld_script.ld), the image still ends before ROM_END.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ta8ykfbWFo924wEqysLhg
